{"id":69321,"date":"2025-08-29T08:24:37","date_gmt":"2025-08-29T07:24:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=69321"},"modified":"2026-10-19T12:26:28","modified_gmt":"2026-10-19T11:26:28","slug":"campeonato-regional-corta-mato-estafeta-mista","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/campeonato-regional-corta-mato-estafeta-mista\/","title":{"rendered":"Campeonato Regional Corta Mato Estafeta Mista 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Campeonato Regional Corta Mato Estafeta Mista 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Campeonato Regional Corta Mato Estafeta Mista 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>17 de outubro de 2026<\/strong>, no <strong>Parque Urbano do Parchal<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Lagoa<\/strong> (distrito de Faro). Integrada na abertura da \u00e9poca desportiva de atletismo 2026\/2027 no Algarve, esta competi\u00e7\u00e3o oficial de corta-mato re\u00fane equipas mistas (dois atletas masculinos e duas atletas femininas por forma\u00e7\u00e3o) nos escal\u00f5es de <strong>Sub-14<\/strong>, <strong>Sub-16<\/strong> e <strong>Absoluto<\/strong> (Sub-18, Sub-20, Sub-23, Seniores e Veteranos), al\u00e9m de provas extra dedicadas aos jovens escal\u00f5es de forma\u00e7\u00e3o <strong>Sub-10<\/strong> e <strong>Sub-12<\/strong> (benjamins e infantis).<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O tra\u00e7ado em relva e terra batida do <strong>Parque Urbano do Parchal<\/strong>, situado na margem oriental do estu\u00e1rio do <strong>Rio Arade<\/strong> entre Ferragudo e Mexilhoeira da Carrega\u00e7\u00e3o, proporciona um circuito r\u00e1pido, plano e com excelente visibilidade para o p\u00fablico acompanhar as transmiss\u00f5es de testemunho. A competi\u00e7\u00e3o disputa-se exclusivamente em formato de estafeta de 4 percursos (1\u00ba masculino, 2\u00aa feminina, 3\u00ba masculino e 4\u00aa feminina): <strong>2,6 km<\/strong> (4 x 650 m) para Sub-14 \u00e0s <strong>10:00<\/strong>, <strong>4 km<\/strong> (4 x 1.000 m) para Sub-16 \u00e0s <strong>10:20<\/strong>, <strong>800 m<\/strong> (4 x 200 m) para Sub-10 \u00e0s <strong>10:40<\/strong>, <strong>1 km<\/strong> (4 x 250 m) para Sub-12 \u00e0s <strong>11:00<\/strong> e a prova principal <strong>Absoluta de 5,6 km<\/strong> (4 x 1.400 m) \u00e0s <strong>11:30<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo do Algarve (AAALG)<\/strong> em parceria com a <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Acad\u00e9mica da Bela Vista<\/strong> e com o apoio institucional da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Lagoa<\/strong>, o campeonato exige a valida\u00e7\u00e3o da constitui\u00e7\u00e3o das equipas no secretariado at\u00e9 \u00e0s 09:00 para entrega dos testemunhos com chip de cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica, culminando na cerim\u00f3nia protocolar de entrega de medalhas coletivas \u00e0s 12:00.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">17 de Outubro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Parque Urbano do Parchal, Lagoa, Faro<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-dir