ds\/ficheiros\/eventos\/3b6f217.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Abrir Regulamento Oficial (PDF) &rarr;<br \/>\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corta-Mato \u2022 Campeonato Regional<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Estafeta Mista Absoluto (5,6 km \u2013 4 x 1.400 m)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 17 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 11:30<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">Gratuito<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corta-Mato \u2022 Campeonato Regional<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Estafeta Mista Sub-16 (4 km \u2013 4 x 1.000 m)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 17 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:20<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">Gratuito<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corta-Mato \u2022 Campeonato Regional<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Estafeta Mista Sub-14 (2,6 km \u2013 4 x 650 m)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 17 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">Gratuito<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corta-Mato \u2022 Atividade Extra<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Estafeta Mista Sub-12 Kids (1 km \u2013 4 x 250 m)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 17 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 11:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">Gratuito<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corta-Mato \u2022 Atividade Extra<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Estafeta Mista Sub-10 Kids (800 m \u2013 4 x 200 m)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 17 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:40<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">Gratuito<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Campeonato Regional Corta Mato Estafeta Mista 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A competi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 17 de outubro de 2026, a partir das 10:00, no circuito do Parque Urbano do Parchal, no concelho de Lagoa (distrito de Faro).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios e dist\u00e2ncias de cada escal\u00e3o na Estafeta Mista?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa inicia-se \u00e0s 10:00 com os Sub-14 (2.600 m \u2013 4 x 650 m), seguindo-se \u00e0s 10:20 os Sub-16 (4.000 m \u2013 4 x 1.000 m), \u00e0s 10:40 a atividade extra Sub-10 (800 m \u2013 4 x 200 m), \u00e0s 11:00 os Sub-12 (1.000 m \u2013 4 x 250 m) e \u00e0s 11:30 o escal\u00e3o Absoluto (5.600 m \u2013 4 x 1.400 m). A cerim\u00f3nia protocolar decorre \u00e0s 12:00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como s\u00e3o constitu\u00eddas as equipas e qual \u00e9 a ordem de corrida na estafeta?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Cada equipa \u00e9 composta por 4 atletas filiados na AAALG na \u00e9poca 2026\/2027 (2 masculinos e 2 femininos). A ordem obrigat\u00f3ria dos percursos \u00e9: 1\u00ba percurso \u2013 atleta masculino, 2\u00ba percurso \u2013 atleta feminina, 3\u00ba percurso \u2013 atleta masculino e 4\u00ba percurso \u2013 atleta feminina.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e at\u00e9 que horas devem os clubes levantar os dorsais e testemunhos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os dorsais e testemunhos (com sistema de chips) s\u00e3o levantados no secretariado da competi\u00e7\u00e3o no Parque Urbano do Parchal. Os clubes devem entregar a constitui\u00e7\u00e3o definitiva das equipas at\u00e9 \u00e0s 09:00 (ou at\u00e9 1 hora antes da respetiva prova) para valida\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza o Campeonato Regional de Corta-Mato \u2013 Estafeta Mista?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 organizada pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo do Algarve (AAALG) em conjunto com a Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Acad\u00e9mica da Bela Vista, contando com o apoio da C\u00e2mara Municipal de Lagoa.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Campeonato Regional Corta Mato Estafeta Mista 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-17\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Parque Urbano do Parchal, Lagoa\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Lagoa\", \"addressRegion\": \"Faro\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo do Algarve e Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Acad\u00e9mica da Bela Vista\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Campeonato Regional Corta Mato Estafeta Mista 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A competi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 17 de outubro de 2026, a partir das 10:00, no circuito do Parque Urbano do Parchal, no concelho de Lagoa (distrito de Faro).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios e dist\u00e2ncias de cada escal\u00e3o na Estafeta Mista?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa inicia-se \u00e0s 10:00 com os Sub-14 (2.600 m \u2013 4 x 650 m), seguindo-se \u00e0s 10:20 os Sub-16 (4.000 m \u2013 4 x 1.000 m), \u00e0s 10:40 a atividade extra Sub-10 (800 m \u2013 4 x 200 m), \u00e0s 11:00 os Sub-12 (1.000 m \u2013 4 x 250 m) e \u00e0s 11:30 o escal\u00e3o Absoluto (5.600 m \u2013 4 x 1.400 m). A cerim\u00f3nia protocolar decorre \u00e0s 12:00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como s\u00e3o constitu\u00eddas as equipas e qual \u00e9 a ordem de corrida na estafeta?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Cada equipa \u00e9 composta por 4 atletas filiados na AAALG na \u00e9poca 2026\/2027 (2 masculinos e 2 femininos). A ordem obrigat\u00f3ria dos percursos \u00e9: 1\u00ba percurso \u2013 atleta masculino, 2\u00ba percurso \u2013 atleta feminina, 3\u00ba percurso \u2013 atleta masculino e 4\u00ba percurso \u2013 atleta feminina.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e at\u00e9 que horas devem os clubes levantar os dorsais e testemunhos?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os dorsais e testemunhos (com sistema de chips) s\u00e3o levantados no secretariado da competi\u00e7\u00e3o no Parque Urbano do Parchal. Os clubes devem entregar a constitui\u00e7\u00e3o definitiva das equipas at\u00e9 \u00e0s 09:00 (ou at\u00e9 1 hora antes da respetiva prova) para valida\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem organiza o Campeonato Regional de Corta-Mato \u2013 Estafeta Mista?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova \u00e9 organizada pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo do Algarve (AAALG) em conjunto com a Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Acad\u00e9mica da Bela Vista, contando com o apoio da C\u00e2mara Municipal de Lagoa.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":69655,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,478,624],"event_type_2":[728,149,820],"event_type_3":[744],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-69321","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-lagoa-faro","event_type-corrida","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type-kids","event_type_2-algarve-e-sul","event_type_2-faro","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_3-gratuita-sim"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\